  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Rockstar — Innate Technique (6th level)</em></p><p>At 6th level, you have learned to apply your Sound Blast to an area. As an action for 5 cursed energy, you can launch a Sound Wave in a 15 feet cone. All creatures within range must make a Constitution saving throw or take your Sound Blast damage + additional d10s equal to your proficiency bonus and be pushed back 20 feet and deafened until the end of their next turn on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful save.</p>\n<p>The range of your Sound Blast now increases to 60 feet. The range of your Sound Wave increases to 30 feet at 11th level.</p>",
